      ],
      "source": "https://www.traveliowa.com/cities/adel-iowa/230/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic Adel courthouse, built in the late 19th century, sits on brick streets that reflect the town’s turn‑of‑the‑century architecture.",
